OL,3,GNEWSANo approval for Alderney data
OL,4,Acentre - government
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo plans have been approved to build a
OL,7,Fdata centre on Alderney, despite recent
OL,8,Fclaims, the island's government has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe States of Alderney said in July it
OL,12,Fwanted to explore the idea of building
OL,13,Fa centre after an independent
OL,14,Ffeasibility study found one would be
OL,15,F"economically transformational".
OL,17,FBut members of the Policy and Finance
OL,18,FCommittee said no centre had yet been
OL,19,Fapproved, "no developer has been
OL,20,Fappointed, no site has been selected,
OL,21,Fand no development agreement has been
OL,22,Fentered into".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
