OL,3,GNEWSANo approval for Alderney data
OL,4,Acentre - government
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the work undertaken thus far
OL,7,Fwas "exploratory" and was intended to
OL,8,Festablish whether there was a "credible
OL,9,Fopportunity sufficiently beneficial to
OL,10,FAlderney to warrant further
OL,11,Fconsideration".
